    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περσ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speak Persian</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>imitate the Persians</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τε σκευῇ καὶ τῇ φωνῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.6.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.11.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>take the side of the Persians</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.2.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>take the side of Perseus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				30.5a
			</span></i>.</div>
